        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "          148 Kandih Paap Guay Phungc Diuc khang",
            "                                7.7.10.7. Ref. 9.6.9.6",
            "          Doh hei E",
            "",
            "          1. Kandih paap guay phungc diuc khang,",
            "             Maansei guay ta gulou khang,",
            "             Ravguangc Nac Mpouh khatnamei Jisu",
            "             Puanclou the Bethlehem khou.",
            "",
            "                      'Dih neihlaamei chamv gay liangmei tei",
            "                      Kabamv kathuihna khou,",
            "                      Kata thay makpui bamv kathuih khou,",
            "                      Kaucna dinc ruan di kho.",
            "",
            "          2. Nang lev aniw meic guay ta,",
            "             Paapc bangc swbammei khourui,",
            "             Poubauhmei Ravguangc ta laalou diu khang,",
            "             Puanclou the Bethlehem khou.",
            "",
            "          3. Kandih paap khou 'maan bammei,",
            "             Zinghmei khou bammei guay ta,",
            "             Phaengc zauc lana nang nzian makna cho?",
            "             Duakpat diu khang tat di kho."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
